From 8b59f18d4edefd9406efc7b4f83aa14402e05e80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bram Stolk <b.stolk@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 May 2025 10:59:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Adds new functionality to framing: annotation.

This adds an annotation text that can be printed into the border.
ASCII only, with a single fixed-width font.

To use it, Framing+Resizing needs to be enabled, and Framing needs to be
enabled.

Frame size must be at least 30 pixels.
